# ============================================================
# BREATHER DEGRADATION ANALYSIS
# MAHALANOBIS + HEALTHY P95 MULTIPLIER + PERSISTENCE
#
# FINAL DEMO VERSION
#
# LOGIC:
#
# 1. Load takeoff data
# 2. Load replacement data
# 3. Keep ESNs with exactly ONE replacement event
# 4. Merge replacement date
# 5. Split BEFORE / AFTER replacement
# 6. From BEFORE data, keep only max(Run_Number) == 1
# 7. EMA(5), independently per ESN
# 8. Normalize life to 0-100%
# 9. Healthy baseline = 20-60% life
# 10. Calculate ESN-specific Mahalanobis score
# 11. Rolling Mahalanobis score
# 12. Remove isolated sensor fluctuations
# 13. Calculate healthy 95th percentile from 20-60%
# 14. Multiply healthy P95 by threshold multiplier
# 15. Detect 5 consecutive points above threshold
# 16. Record first sustained crossing
# 17. Record subsequent sustained crossings
# 18. Calculate warning lead before replacement
# 19. Generate presentation-ready plots
# 20. Mark 100% life with thick black replacement line
#
# NO ISOLATION FOREST
# NO NEW ML MODEL
# NO AFTER-REPLACEMENT DATA IN MAHALANOBIS CALCULATION
# ============================================================


